issue('C-A09','Compact','Blocker',117,'Gearbox intersects wheel hub and shaft engagement is incomplete','Right motor centre Y=42.5; gearbox Y=55..61. Wheel centre=58.5, integral hub Y=50.5..66.5 with Ø3.2 bore. Ø12 gearbox occupies that hub bore region. Shaft Y=61..69 gives only 5.5 mm engagement within 16 mm integral hub.','Use exact motor face-to-shaft dimensions and actual bought wheel hub depth; resolve gearbox/hub collision before print.')
